**Vault rule copy:** `AI-BOS/.cursor/rules/84-ai-bos-mkos-binding.mdc`

When working in the Marketing OS lane, treat delivery context as **`PRJ-GRO-MKOS-001`**.

## Mandatory

1. Read `AI-BOS/project-registry/registry.json` entry `PRJ-GRO-MKOS-001`.
2. Load `RU-AI-BOS-MKOS-001` + `HB-GRO-MKOS-001` + division handbook.
